Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)来吧 嘎嘎嘎嘎～尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(嘎嘎嘎嘎～尔)嘎嘎嘎！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)游马君～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君 不好了 出大事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别管了快过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.61,0:00:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小猫)你这只麻雀女！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)干嘛啊 你这只猫妖娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.27,0:00:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 住手啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们在干什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了发生什么事了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.79,0:00:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个 刚才大家在一起聊天的时候…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((吉祥物女孩？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！ 我们觉得这样比较好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给Number's Club
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做一个吉祥物女孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)哦哦 不错嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.74,0:00:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)可是 谁来当呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那果然还是小鸟同学吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 我来！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为 No.俱乐部的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你目击到的最多吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.55,0:00:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 你还是游马的女朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.29,0:01:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}讨厌啦 我才不是游马的女朋友呢…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)可是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.41,0:01:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟同学不是不会决斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.47,0:01:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.俱乐部的吉祥物女孩{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.01,0:01:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然不会决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能嘛～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.25,0:01:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔嚓！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话 这里果然还是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该让决斗很厉害的 凯西小姐来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.09,0:01:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会玩决斗就了不起啊 你这只化猫娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔嚓！))
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是因为你说了多余的话吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.36,0:01:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我明明是为你好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.24,0:01:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.57,0:01:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马你闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.03,0:01:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.17,0:01:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟游马没关系！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.79,0:01:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)大家 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.47,0:01:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)这么晚了 都聚在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)璃绪小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！ 吉祥物女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.75,0:01:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让璃绪小姐来不就好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:01:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼附赠的那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么就成了吉祥物女孩！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赠品？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是想找我打架的话我奉陪哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)真是的 铁男君别多嘴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.66,0:02:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就直说了吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男和璃绪小姐简直是美女与野兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.97,0:02:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.69,0:02:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 住手啊 住手啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟和猫咪都冷静一点！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.37,0:02:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奸笑)这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.53,0:02:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定是个机会呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)这样好吗 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别管他们啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是说关系越好越容易吵架嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.38,0:02:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到了明天{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会一下子和好啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是那样的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为 那个是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.06,0:03:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 那群家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 鲨鱼妹！ 那个啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 那个… 就是。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.19,0:03:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊 什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家一下子就都回去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样不就没法决斗了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.64,0:03:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话 我来 当你的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.81,0:03:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你来？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这是为你好。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(瞪)喂 九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.83,0:03:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 你是谁啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.29,0:03:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马 跟我决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}运动决斗大会!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要解决你们的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就只能靠运动决斗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用清爽流淌的汗水{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把同伴之间的羁绊夺回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.59,0:05:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。不错呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.51,0:05:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}运动决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但有一件重要的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，如果你留到了决赛的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要把胜利让给对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为目的是让大家和好。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴夺冠的话那份羁绊就会更加深厚。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得真好呢，你。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，不过你为什么愿意帮我？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？啊，那个嘛……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.27,0:06:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，对，我是你的粉丝，超级大粉丝。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.57,0:06:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，这样啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么这周日大家一起去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.09,0:06:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}运动决斗大会！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.77,0:06:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 真月去通知大家吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 好！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(有栖)喂 基拉古你在打什么鬼主意？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿有栖 我想到了一个好计策。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 虽然不知道你在想什么{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要打倒九十九游马的 是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 随你便。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这样一来 No.卡就是我的了》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 现在开始第一届 心园市
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}运动决斗大会。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～ 大家加油上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这是为你们好！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:07:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得提不起劲啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.01,0:07:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烦死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.67,0:07:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}若是决胜负 我可不会输哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)为什么连我也……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 嘛 大家别说那种话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天好好享受吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.21,0:07:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 我来宣布规则。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.55,0:07:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是边做运动边进行的抢人赛{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每赢一场得1分。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前两名的队伍进入决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 分组如下。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马·鲨鱼队。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}委员长·德之助队。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男·璃绪队。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫·小鸟队。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊 这分组！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.74,0:07:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么把小鸟喵和我分一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.80,0:07:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 很幸福哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了好了 各位。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}优胜者将{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得成为Numbers俱乐部吉祥物女孩的权利
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.81,0:07:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被授予哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.03,0:07:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 首先 决定场地。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一个项目是这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空中跳水！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 第一回合是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以天空为舞台的空中跳水决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.45,0:08:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 空鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一回合是 游马·鲨鱼队的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.10,0:08:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}华丽胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.28,0:08:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克风]场地变换
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来是沙滩排球决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.91,0:08:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了哦 铁男君。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.46,0:08:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.16,0:08:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《璃绪小姐 请看着我》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.63,0:08:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那副样子 真让人火大！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男君 痛恨的失误！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.19,0:09:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛 碍事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边的台词才对！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀，同伴之间起内讧了开始了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这可不行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克风]目前游马·鲨鱼队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正处于领先位置。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（光芒）到场地上去～。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.08,0:09:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，极光之翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}偶尔像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.01,0:09:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做做运动也不错啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.29,0:09:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊，说到底。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.05,0:09:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能把烦心事都忘掉呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:09:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}羡慕羡慕！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起是我拖后腿了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没那回事，凯特。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.37,0:10:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）两位。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.49,0:10:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打得真漂亮，下次务必
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.72,0:10:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请陪我决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乐意奉陪喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.11,0:10:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君 友好作战看来进展顺利！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 呼～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总算没白辛苦一场。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}辛苦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.95,0:10:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不还是一如既往地轻轻松松{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵、吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 那么各位
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.33,0:10:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来宣布晋级决赛的组合。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一组是 游马·鲨鱼队。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.11,0:10:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手竟然是暗黑马
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫酱·小鸟队。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.07,0:10:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为、为什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明我和璃绪的分数应该更高才对啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.27,0:10:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}女生之间的组队有1万点的奖励分。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么小鸟同学，小猫。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.49,0:11:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有东西想交给你们，请跟我来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.65,0:11:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）想交给我们的东西是什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}肯定是稀有卡之类的喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.77,0:11:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。有一张卡，务必想请
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们两位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.10,0:11:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵，这样一来准备就完美了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.49,0:11:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的就是游马故意输给这些家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.27,0:11:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把 No.们 全都……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 接下来进行决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.72,0:11:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决赛场地是…… 这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}棒球决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 选手入场！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克风]小猫·小鸟队！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手是 我高最强决斗者！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克风]游马·鲨鱼队！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！ 干起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.08,0:12:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你明白的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.71,0:12:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决赛 你要故意输掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 她们的羁绊就会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更加深厚。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.39,0:12:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！ 明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 凌牙君……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.94,0:12:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 哎呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌、凌牙君！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.85,0:12:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙君去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.29,0:12:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥已经回去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.01,0:12:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底就是这种事儿谁干得下去啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没办法了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:12:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就你来当替补投手吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？我来？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下！我那个……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？这什么打扮！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.53,0:13:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.69,0:13:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等、等等！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.55,0:13:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《等一下啊……她们不是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.63,0:13:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拿着混沌之力吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.32,0:13:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以游马故意输掉对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 星光体不也会消失吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.17,0:13:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 连我也会跟着消失不是吗？》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.61,0:13:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马你真的打算故意输掉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.87,0:13:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 既然要故意输的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 那个 游马君…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 针剑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖伏一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这个笨蛋！ 居然召唤那么弱的怪兽》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 猫女郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.71,0:14:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(猫女郎)喵！ 猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.15,0:14:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 猫女郎 攻击针剑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.15,0:14:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～！ 猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《糟了！ 这下糟了！》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然这里还是认真打一场怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话 和好作战不就泡汤了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会输得很难看的啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《糟了糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.95,0:14:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那帮家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是发动了异晶界之力的话我就…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.56,0:14:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在发动之前把它破坏掉就行了…》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 魔法手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放２张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(瞪)那个抽卡 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 魔法搜索！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是对方抽卡的代替{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组把１张魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.84,0:15:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加入手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.99,0:15:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这样一来 那家伙就必定会把
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}屏障之力加入手牌》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还要发动 魔法手的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方从卡组将卡加入手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡是魔法卡的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.35,0:15:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏那张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.65,0:15:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给予800点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这样一来就能破坏屏障之力了》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊… 真是的 没办法啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要使用我的陷阱 健忘。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!? 你要帮我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}借我力量吧陷阱发动 健忘！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.77,0:15:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是在场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.65,0:15:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动效果的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽变为守备表示
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:15:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并使其效果无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我的怪兽效果白费了》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行啊得让那帮家伙赢不了才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 小妖精·莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.69,0:16:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动 这只怪兽的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1张手牌送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.29,0:16:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽的等级上升1。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 等级4的怪兽就有2只了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.75,0:16:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 不要…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 等级4的猫娘和
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小妖精·莉莉叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 妖精啦啦队女孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（妖精啦啦队女孩）加油加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦～！ 好厉害啊 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.72,0:16:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟同学 真有一套呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.70,0:16:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直披着猫皮的里人格。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:16:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）总觉得有点不对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.65,0:17:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.53,0:17:03.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那两个人 跟刚才相比气氛和刚才不一样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.20,0:17:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这难道是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.31,0:17:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妖精啦啦队女孩的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次，使用超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.55,0:17:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了 糟了啊我会消失吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.32,0:17:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这难道是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下这一招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法 异热同心之力发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.52,0:17:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.69,0:17:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经不行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让怪兽超量怪的阶级
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升1阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其变身成混沌超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用妖精啦啦队女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.15,0:17:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:17:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.80,0:18:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是现身之时伟大异热同心力量的象征！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量 暗黑妖精骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 小鸟和猫咪酱会变成巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经 完蛋了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.39,0:18:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑妖精 魔法·手攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妖精派对！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间 暗黑妖精的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.41,0:18:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗破坏对方怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个混沌超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1张自己的手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给予500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.37,0:18:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌是4张。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.32,0:18:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此接下2000的伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.90,0:19:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.45,0:19:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两个人竟然被巴利安洗脑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行了 完蛋了 我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了救出小鸟她们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能赢下这场决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，不能故意输掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.30,0:19:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.07,0:19:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜利的方程式完成了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤嘎嘎嘎女孩。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.39,0:19:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡 等级大师。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是将手牌的怪兽送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让场上的1只怪兽的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.19,0:19:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在送入墓地的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级以下的范围内提升。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将嘎嘎嘎女孩的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.43,0:19:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从3提升到4。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.74,0:19:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后发动魔法卡 死者苏生。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧，嘎嘎嘎魔法师！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.39,0:20:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的嘎嘎嘎魔法师和
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我少女效果发动，超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.13,0:20:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.25,0:20:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧， pinch hitter
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.53,0:20:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.03,0:20:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力是2500。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.05,0:20:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算攻击也只会同归于尽哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量素材的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我少女的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.25,0:20:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将对方1只超量怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}归零归零！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，用我的陷阱卡 手之力吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 手之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。这张卡是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己墓地的手怪兽除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.69,0:20:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己怪兽的攻击力变成两倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将墓地的魔法手除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来霍普的攻击力是２倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.43,0:20:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.05,0:21:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑 逆转满垒本垒打！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.48,0:21:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得 得救了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你们没事吧？ 喂。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦 游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.01,0:21:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们 刚才在干什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.05,0:21:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咔嚓)咔嚓 记忆…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么说 你真的不记得了吗这场决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.87,0:21:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 做个了断吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}达令 来决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}饶了我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.05,0:21:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟她们)等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你们赢了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.69,0:21:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马 今天被你救了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:21:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次 给我… 记住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.58,0:22:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以跟你们的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.68,0:22:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经受够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.19,0:23:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.34,0:23:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.74,0:23:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.57,0:23:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.27,0:23:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.21,0:24:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.19,0:24:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.16,0:24:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
